= Federation (information technology) — Technical =

Federation requires explicit boundaries between administrative domains plus mechanisms for exchanging claims or activities across those boundaries. Trust can be bilateral, brokered, metadata-driven, cryptographic, policy-based, or some combination.

== Modeling / implementation cautions ==
* federation ≠ decentralization
* federation ≠ single sign-on
* federation ≠ one administrative domain

